  "details": "the title is on the tin. as tested by me and Kung, the 3-point and desktop IK uses the previous position as the origin of transition animations during locomotion.\nThis happens on both AV2 and AV3 avatars, on the Beta IK, not legacy.\nVideo of it happening\nhttps://raytracing-benchmarks.are-really.cool/4r2ezea.mp4 \nRelevant Discord conversation in the IK 2.0 beta channel https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/946881839400882196/966616634406105119",
